Subject: [PATCH] Keep ASCII results compact in more string builders

atob, String.fromCharCode, toLowerCase and toUpperCase, replace and
replaceAll, and the TypedArray join and toLocaleString methods start with
compact one-byte storage when their output is ASCII and widen only when a
non-ASCII character appears.

Adds a JSLibTest case for mixed ASCII and Unicode output. The runtime's
WASI build does not compile Hermes unit tests; run it from a host Hermes
build with HERMES_ENABLE_TEST_SUITE=ON.

Performance only; results do not change.

Upstream: not submitted.
